                        {
                            "id": "b",
                            "text": "1, because the imported binding reflects the exporter's update"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "c",
                            "text": "undefined, because let cannot be exported"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "d",
                            "text": "A promise fulfilled with 1"
                        }
                    ],
                    "correctOptionId": "b"
                },
                "gradingConfig": {
                    "questionType": "multiple_choice_single"
                },
                "explanation": "ECMAScript imports are live bindings to exported values. After increment updates the exporter's count, reading the imported binding gives 1."
